        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$1 . 0 \times \sqrt{\frac{0 . 2}{\pi}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>Tv를 잘못 계산한 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$1 . 0 \times \sqrt{\frac{0 . 4}{\pi}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>양면배수 H = 5 m, Tv = 0.1, U = √(0.4/π)이므로 1.0 × √(0.4/π)로 정답이다.</commentary>
